      "cooked": "<p>So... Hi everyone! It's been a while.&nbsp;</p><p>There's been a bit of discussion on the sudden appearance of a message in the <strong>New &amp; Updated Topics</strong>&nbsp;list. What you see is normal. There was some shuffling around of topics and these \"signposts\" were leftover to let everyone know that things have moved. For whatever reason, the list of&nbsp;New &amp; Updated Topics wants to display this rather than the actual post.&nbsp;</p><p>Rest assured that if a post is appearing in the&nbsp;New &amp; Updated Topics list, there <strong>are</strong> new replies in the topic. I'm going to sort out how to fix this, but in the meantime, please be patient. :)</p><p>(Between you and me, I think Omnitron-X was a <em>little</em> too helpful and rearranged the forums to be more, ahem, <em>logical</em>. Silly computers!)</p>",
